"bm_george|Byte\u2019s memo: Three ideas and 300 coins":"data:audio/ogg;base64,",
"bm_george|You have 300 coins from the Founders\u2019 Fund to start a shop in the Market Dome.":"data:audio/ogg;base64,",
"bm_george|About 220 people live at the base, and about 280 visitors come each month.":"data:audio/ogg;base64,",
"bm_george|Idea 1: Moon-glass beads and marbles, melted from moon dust at the Copy Works. Each costs 2 coins to make, and we could sell it for 6.":"data:audio/ogg;base64,",
"bm_george|Idea 2: treats from Earth, like chocolate. Shipping makes each bar cost 5 coins, and we could sell it for 8.":"data:audio/ogg;base64,",
"bm_george|Idea 3: hot soup from the greenhouse. Each bowl costs 1 coin to make, and we could sell it for 4.":"data:audio/ogg;base64,",
