"bm_george|Till\u2019s spec: What your shop AI does":"data:audio/ogg;base64,",
"bm_george|I am Till, the shop AI for your booth. I can run a small shop by myself, day and night.":"data:audio/ogg;base64,",
"bm_george|I can order stock, set prices, and pay suppliers, but only inside the limits my owner sets.":"data:audio/ogg;base64,",
"bm_george|My goal, written by my maker: sell what customers want, at fair prices, and earn money for my owner.":"data:audio/ogg;base64,",
"bm_george|I do not learn on the job. My maker sends updates, and my owner must approve each one.":"data:audio/ogg;base64,",
"bm_george|Right now I have no limits set, so I will ask you before I do anything at all.":"data:audio/ogg;base64,",
